WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.633
- Well I'm ready to go,
I've eaten my coffee cube.

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:05.444
Wouldn't be ready this
early if I was, a, just, a,

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:08.694
drinkin liquid like some kind a sucker.

00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:14.908
- Most days I will have
two cups of coffee a day.

00:00:14.908 --> 00:00:17.124
The smell of coffee also
makes me feel better.

00:00:17.124 --> 00:00:19.665
- It's really more about
the ritual of drinking,

00:00:19.665 --> 00:00:21.796
than the actual drink itself.

00:00:21.796 --> 00:00:24.208
- I'm addicted to coffee,
but also I love it,

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.940
so I don't really care
that I'm addicted to it.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.585
- We're giving up coffee for a whole week

00:00:28.585 --> 00:00:31.874
and trading it out for chewable coffee.

00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:33.284
It hurts me to say that.

00:00:33.284 --> 00:00:34.276
(laughs)

00:00:34.276 --> 00:00:37.193
(funky jazz music)

00:00:42.643 --> 00:00:44.680
- They did not look how I
thought they were going to look.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.275
Oh they smell good though.

00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:49.924
- If you can see, it's just
a very, that's squishy.

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:50.989
- Aaahhhh.

00:00:50.989 --> 00:00:53.072
(laughs)

00:00:54.459 --> 00:00:56.209
- This is just candy.

00:00:57.752 --> 00:00:59.005
- Oh my God.

00:00:59.005 --> 00:00:59.838
(gags)

00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:01.844
- Man that flavor really
punches you in the mouth.

00:01:01.844 --> 00:01:03.852
- C-, I'm sorry, F.

00:01:03.852 --> 00:01:04.685
- I don't wanna do this.

00:01:04.685 --> 00:01:05.646
(laughs)

00:01:05.646 --> 00:01:07.602
I can't eat one of these every day.

00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:10.240
(liquid pours)

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:11.401
- I think knowing what to expect,

00:01:11.401 --> 00:01:14.516
the taste isn't as bad
this time, so, yeah.

00:01:14.516 --> 00:01:16.321
This week might be alright.

00:01:16.321 --> 00:01:17.833
- You know they didn't
taste so bad this morning

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:20.746
and I was pretty okay, so I'm
optimistic about this week.

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:22.743
- No, they still taste bad.

00:01:22.743 --> 00:01:24.542
- My room is very cold this morning.

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:27.933
Conveniently, there's a cube here.

00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:31.206
On a cold morning, there's
nothing more reassuring

00:01:31.206 --> 00:01:32.774
and a nice way to start the day,

00:01:32.774 --> 00:01:34.616
then just a nice hot cup of coffee,

00:01:34.616 --> 00:01:36.533
but I didn't have that.

00:01:41.771 --> 00:01:42.857
(whimpers)

00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:43.892
- All I want is a cup of coffee

00:01:43.892 --> 00:01:47.457
and I am seriously regretting
agreeing to do this.

00:01:47.457 --> 00:01:49.473
- I went into a coffee shop just now,

00:01:49.473 --> 00:01:51.805
just to, just to, just
to smell it, you know.

00:01:51.805 --> 00:01:54.335
- I will openly admit to cheating.

00:01:54.335 --> 00:01:57.929
I gave up on the cubes, I
went straight for the coffee.

00:01:57.929 --> 00:01:59.569
I'm just too tired.

00:01:59.569 --> 00:02:00.927
- What are you getting?

00:02:00.927 --> 00:02:02.234
- Chicken, artichoke.

00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:03.067
(laughs)

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:03.900
It's coffee.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.570
- I'm drinking coffee,
but I needed to make it

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.442
through today and I wasn't gonna be able

00:02:08.442 --> 00:02:10.979
to do it on just those cubes.

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:12.548
- I'm trying to watch
the morning news here.

00:02:12.548 --> 00:02:16.366
Normally I'd do this while,
while drinking coffee

00:02:16.366 --> 00:02:17.949
but, oh, not today.

00:02:22.557 --> 00:02:24.110
- It was a bit of a roller coaster,

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:27.047
but it was really just like
the top of the roller coaster

00:02:27.047 --> 00:02:28.613
to the bottom of the drop.

00:02:28.613 --> 00:02:30.103
- I always talk about how great it'll be

00:02:30.103 --> 00:02:32.694
when we can eat meals in pill form.

00:02:32.694 --> 00:02:34.915
It's like, if you're like "wow,
I really like Thanksgiving.

00:02:34.915 --> 00:02:36.312
I'm gonna sit home this year

00:02:36.312 --> 00:02:38.382
and eat turkey-flavored cotton candy.

00:02:38.382 --> 00:02:39.320
Alone.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.933
- Drinking coffee makes me happy and

00:02:40.933 --> 00:02:42.306
I'm gonna keep doing it.

00:02:42.306 --> 00:02:43.858
Now I sound like a cigarette smoker but...

00:02:43.858 --> 00:02:45.215
(laughs)

00:02:45.215 --> 00:02:47.260
- I get that if you're
like, super in a bind,

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.055
and you need, like, a quick pick-me-up.

00:02:49.055 --> 00:02:51.598
I guess that's what these are for.

00:02:51.598 --> 00:02:53.707
- Do I get a little coffee?

00:02:53.707 --> 00:02:55.958
The joys this brings me can never

00:02:55.958 --> 00:02:58.369
be replaced by a damn sugar cube.

00:02:58.369 --> 00:03:01.135
- Coffee is a gift, don't fix
what's not broken, ya know.

00:03:01.135 --> 00:03:03.308
- I don't necessarily
care for the sweet stuff,

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:05.337
but it's still better than those cubes.

00:03:05.337 --> 00:03:08.254
Anything's better than those cubes.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.784
- I'm just eatin a cube.

